WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 44=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.110
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:42.310 --> 01:42.840
Keep looking.

01:43.040 --> 01:43.840
Check over there.

01:44.590 --> 01:45.400
Nothing here.

01:45.400 --> 01:46.950
I'm just an innocent passerby.

01:47.280 --> 01:49.200
We're the victims
whose lives are at stake.

01:50.408 --> 01:51.920
Those bandits kill without hesitation.

01:52.230 --> 01:53.680
We won't put your life at risk.

01:54.184 --> 01:55.070
We'll part ways here.

01:55.080 --> 01:56.488
May our paths never cross again.

01:57.150 --> 01:57.590
Young Lady,

01:58.000 --> 01:59.280
you can't outrun those bandits.

01:59.680 --> 02:00.680
If you trust me,

02:02.870 --> 02:04.560
there's a little-known path here.

02:05.120 --> 02:06.680
You should hide behind the reeds.

02:07.048 --> 02:08.310
I'll draw the bandits away.

02:08.720 --> 02:09.780
- Nothing.
- Nothing here.

02:09.780 --> 02:10.700
Nothing here.

02:14.960 --> 02:15.630
I trust you.

02:16.824 --> 02:18.430
His dagger was made by the government.

02:18.632 --> 02:19.150
Let's go.

02:19.150 --> 02:19.870
Over there.

02:30.750 --> 02:31.470
Help!

02:31.560 --> 02:32.240
Murder!

02:32.240 --> 02:32.710
Shut up!

02:32.710 --> 02:33.910
Help! Murder!

02:39.360 --> 02:40.960
Sir, don't be alarmed.

02:41.280 --> 02:42.710
We're merchants from southern Fujian.

02:43.280 --> 02:44.750
They're guards we hired.

02:44.960 --> 02:46.280
They only look intimidating.

02:46.470 --> 02:48.080
My brother and I came to Jinling

02:48.168 --> 02:49.208
but didn't make any money.

02:49.210 --> 02:51.240
To save on expenses,
we're spending the night here.

02:51.512 --> 02:52.800
But the cook traveling with us

02:52.800 --> 02:54.240
stole our money and ran away.

02:54.840 --> 02:55.470
Sir,

02:55.840 --> 02:57.190
did you happen to see two women?

02:59.360 --> 03:00.630
I've read so much

03:00.664 --> 03:02.216
that my eyesight has grown poor.

03:03.590 --> 03:04.960
I did see someone just now

03:05.430 --> 03:06.630
heading that way,

03:07.192 --> 03:08.910
but I couldn't make out their appearance

03:09.000 --> 03:10.664
or tell whether it was a man or a woman.

03:13.030 --> 03:14.150
Thank you, sir.

03:19.320 --> 03:20.400
There's no need to rush.

03:20.560 --> 03:22.504
My cousin is the magistrate
of Shangyuan County.

03:22.800 --> 03:23.590
My cousin and I

03:23.800 --> 03:24.710
arranged to meet today

03:24.710 --> 03:25.910
at Bali Pavilion nearby.

03:26.008 --> 03:27.390
That fire was quite bright just now.

03:27.400 --> 03:28.460
My cousin must have seen it.

03:28.470 --> 03:30.870
He'll surely bring
the constables with him to meet me.

03:31.128 --> 03:31.800
When he arrives,

03:31.880 --> 03:33.330
he'll certainly be able to help you

03:33.496 --> 03:35.520
bring those two
female thieves to justice.

03:42.870 --> 03:44.280
Every word I've said is true.

03:44.910 --> 03:45.910
I haven't lied to you.

03:48.150 --> 03:49.280
If you two don't believe me,

03:51.360 --> 03:52.280
why not sit down

03:52.800 --> 03:53.800
and wait here for a while?

03:55.520 --> 03:57.630
Money is only a worldly possession.

03:57.840 --> 03:58.800
It comes and goes.

03:58.952 --> 04:00.360
There's no need to dwell on it.

04:01.960 --> 04:03.880
The moon
is especially beautiful tonight.

04:04.536 --> 04:06.080
It shines upon past and present alike.

04:08.240 --> 04:08.750
Gentlemen,

04:09.432 --> 04:11.208
we shouldn't let
such a night go to waste.

04:18.600 --> 04:20.040
We still need to pack our belongings

04:20.040 --> 04:21.496
and hurry back to southern Fujian,

04:21.560 --> 04:23.430
so we won't disturb your enjoyment, sir.

04:44.120 --> 04:44.720
Second Chief,

04:45.120 --> 04:47.120
why aren't we going
after those two weavers?

04:48.510 --> 04:49.630
No, Second Young Master.

04:51.992 --> 04:54.300
Young Master said the weavers
are as insignificant as ants.

04:54.310 --> 04:55.430
They don't matter.

04:55.920 --> 04:58.600
But that pedantic scholar is
from the Xie family of Jinling.

04:58.888 --> 05:01.390
If we kill him now, we'll draw
the attention of the authorities

05:01.560 --> 05:03.120
and Jinling's prominent families.

05:03.256 --> 05:04.712
That would put us at a disadvantage.

05:06.408 --> 05:08.696
Leave no loose ends.
Get out of here as soon as possible.

05:08.750 --> 05:09.750
Leave no trace.

05:10.270 --> 05:11.030
- Yes.
- Yes.

05:11.310 --> 05:11.720
Hurry.

05:15.416 --> 05:16.970
The ones in the back, move it. Keep up.

05:17.630 --> 05:18.160
Move out.

05:28.830 --> 05:29.800
Clean and precise.

05:30.600 --> 05:31.830
Killed with a single strike.

05:32.920 --> 05:34.600
The killer was highly experienced,

05:34.632 --> 05:36.248
and someone accustomed to killing.

05:43.352 --> 05:44.680
Why would someone so experienced

05:44.680 --> 05:46.120
kill a coachman

05:47.310 --> 05:48.190
just

05:49.000 --> 05:50.390
to abduct two weavers?

05:51.112 --> 05:52.648
An enemy of yours, Your Lordship?

05:55.680 --> 05:57.310
If this were an enemy of Jinqi's,

05:57.800 --> 05:58.950
why go out of their way

05:58.950 --> 05:59.950
to abduct Xiuwan?

06:00.216 --> 06:01.600
They should have gone after Lanxiang

06:01.600 --> 06:02.870
or Zhangcheng instead.

06:10.120 --> 06:10.800
The kidnappers

06:11.310 --> 06:12.950
don't know Xiuwan's true identity.

06:13.480 --> 06:14.310
If they did,

06:14.648 --> 06:16.560
they would never
have left the coachman's body

06:16.800 --> 06:18.310
lying carelessly in the woods.

06:18.568 --> 06:21.256
The kidnappers must have assumed
they were two ordinary weavers.

06:21.560 --> 06:22.680
Even if they went missing,

06:22.744 --> 06:24.472
the authorities
wouldn't take it seriously.

06:24.824 --> 06:27.048
They would only send ordinary constables
to investigate.

06:28.630 --> 06:30.360
The wound on his neck alone

06:31.560 --> 06:33.000
doesn't reveal much either.

06:37.560 --> 06:39.960
You already know who
the kidnappers are, Your Lordship.

06:40.920 --> 06:42.070
More than half a month ago,

06:42.248 --> 06:44.830
the Longjiang Garrison was
escorting tribute goods to the capital

06:44.920 --> 06:47.544
when they encountered river bandits
on a tributary of the canal.

06:47.920 --> 06:48.630
Everyone

06:49.750 --> 06:51.040
aboard was killed.

06:51.368 --> 06:52.630
Their wounds were similar?

06:57.608 --> 06:59.870
I heard those river bandits
were exceptionally brutal.

07:00.750 --> 07:01.560
Xiuwan...

07:02.750 --> 07:03.560
Xiuwan...

07:12.580 --> 07:15.740
(Zezhi Workshop)

07:26.240 --> 07:27.560
We're finally back safe and sound.

07:28.216 --> 07:29.070
Second Young Lady.

07:29.630 --> 07:30.160
Come here.

07:32.600 --> 07:33.430
Second Young Lady,

07:33.736 --> 07:34.680
we mustn't tell anyone

07:34.680 --> 07:36.000
about what happened to us.

07:36.070 --> 07:38.808
Why? I was thinking we could
go report it to the authorities later

07:38.824 --> 07:40.230
and have the kidnappers arrested.

07:40.240 --> 07:42.590
No, we can't. My husband
and mother-in-law already disapprove

07:42.600 --> 07:43.810
of me working outside the home.

07:43.820 --> 07:44.750
They say I'm never home.

07:44.840 --> 07:46.510
If they find out
I was abducted by bandits

07:46.510 --> 07:48.580
and didn't come home all night,
they'll surely think

07:49.720 --> 07:50.830
I've been dishonored.

07:52.560 --> 07:54.430
Then the neighbors will gossip

07:55.120 --> 07:56.600
and call me an indecent woman.

07:57.992 --> 07:59.864
I can put up
with what they say about me.

08:00.360 --> 08:02.630
After all, I've spent my whole life
being looked down on.

08:07.560 --> 08:09.680
But my daughter
will soon be discussing marriage.

08:10.510 --> 08:12.040
I can't let this ruin her reputation.

08:14.240 --> 08:15.830
Please take my advice, all right?

08:16.720 --> 08:19.070
I'm sure
your mother would rather suffer herself

08:20.070 --> 08:21.750
than let you become
the subject of gossip

08:21.750 --> 08:23.096
and have your reputation ruined.

08:26.360 --> 08:28.480
Those kidnappers
were clearly the ones who did wrong.

08:28.936 --> 08:31.070
Why should we be
the ones ashamed to face others?

08:34.360 --> 08:35.840
Because we're women.

08:37.790 --> 08:39.360
We were born to suffer.

08:50.136 --> 08:52.680
No wonder Gantang always
says it's hard to recruit workers.

08:53.910 --> 08:55.080
I never understood

08:55.870 --> 08:57.150
why those women

08:58.200 --> 09:00.600
would rather humble themselves
and ask men for money

09:01.200 --> 09:02.840
than go out and earn their own living.

09:04.120 --> 09:06.080
I thought they simply lacked ambition.

09:07.864 --> 09:09.496
It turns out it's simply because...

09:13.000 --> 09:14.200
we're women.

09:25.510 --> 09:26.320
Xiuwan.

09:27.720 --> 09:28.510
Madam.

09:31.020 --> 09:31.940
Lanxiang.

09:39.384 --> 09:40.240
It's all right now.

09:49.176 --> 09:51.360
Go back to work
at Zezhi Workshop without worry.

09:51.670 --> 09:53.270
I already told Gantang yesterday

09:53.670 --> 09:55.840
to keep this quiet
and carry on as usual.

09:56.840 --> 09:58.480
If anyone asks about last night,

09:58.600 --> 09:59.440
just say

09:59.960 --> 10:01.720
Madam wanted to inspect the new loom,

10:01.910 --> 10:04.600
so the Second Young Lady
took you straight to the Lin Residence.

10:04.790 --> 10:06.790
You accidentally missed the curfew,

10:07.240 --> 10:08.320
so you and Shopkeeper Zhou

10:08.550 --> 10:10.200
spent the night at the residence.

10:10.984 --> 10:12.320
You're so compassionate, Madam.

10:12.750 --> 10:13.550
Thank you very much.

10:13.992 --> 10:15.910
I went to the residence
to report back yesterday

10:16.030 --> 10:17.670
and missed the curfew,

10:17.720 --> 10:18.840
so I stayed there overnight.

10:19.320 --> 10:20.390
You were with me.

10:37.480 --> 10:39.440
Are you still thinking
about what Lady Peng said?

10:41.320 --> 10:43.240
If a man encounters criminals

10:43.352 --> 10:44.870
and manages to escape with his life,

10:45.480 --> 10:47.510
everyone would be happy for him.

10:49.030 --> 10:50.120
But for women,

10:53.848 --> 10:56.240
it's as if we're
the ones who've done something wrong,

10:56.630 --> 10:58.150
terrified that anyone might find out.

11:00.080 --> 11:01.630
When a man brings money home,

11:02.120 --> 11:04.840
everyone praises him as
a good husband and father.

11:05.960 --> 11:08.240
When a woman works hard
and brings money home,

11:08.790 --> 11:10.320
not only does no one praise her,

11:10.390 --> 11:12.000
but people also gossip about her.

11:13.960 --> 11:15.390
What infuriates me most is

11:15.750 --> 11:17.750
that it's bad enough
for men to think that way,

11:18.360 --> 11:20.270
but even women themselves believe it,

11:21.016 --> 11:22.750
thinking that showing themselves
in public

11:22.910 --> 11:24.150
and working to earn money

11:25.080 --> 11:26.320
makes them inferior.

11:33.120 --> 11:35.990
If a gentleman wishes to enlighten
the people and improve their customs,

11:36.000 --> 11:37.440
he must begin with education.

11:38.870 --> 11:40.630
Women aren't ignorant or foolish.

11:42.150 --> 11:43.750
No one has simply ever told them

11:44.630 --> 11:45.840
that going out to earn money

11:46.270 --> 11:47.840
and supporting themselves

11:48.720 --> 11:50.240
is nothing to be ashamed of.

11:57.080 --> 11:58.200
That makes sense.

11:59.600 --> 12:00.720
Jade left uncarved

12:01.320 --> 12:02.600
cannot become a useful vessel.

12:03.720 --> 12:04.840
A person without learning

12:05.510 --> 12:06.440
cannot know the way.

12:09.910 --> 12:11.440
But that's simply the world we live in.

12:17.080 --> 12:18.270
Lanxiang, you want to become

12:18.790 --> 12:20.550
a teacher who enlightens women?

12:22.790 --> 12:23.840
It's not just me.

12:24.720 --> 12:25.630
There's also you.

12:26.200 --> 12:27.000
Me?

12:28.750 --> 12:30.390
You defied what others might think

12:30.440 --> 12:31.840
and went to work at Zezhi Workshop,

12:32.630 --> 12:34.000
earning your own living.

12:34.200 --> 12:37.550
That's teaching by example.

12:40.080 --> 12:41.270
Gantang even said

12:41.480 --> 12:43.000
that since you joined Zezhi Workshop,

12:43.270 --> 12:44.510
the women there

12:44.720 --> 12:46.870
have been laughing
and talking more than ever.

12:48.030 --> 12:48.840
I...

12:49.000 --> 12:50.440
I just talk a lot,

12:50.750 --> 12:52.440
and I haven't had much schooling.

12:52.630 --> 12:54.870
How could I ever teach others the way?

12:58.960 --> 13:00.030
The scriptures say,

13:00.750 --> 13:03.000
"From one lamp, many lamps are lit,

13:04.120 --> 13:05.840
until ten thousand lamps shine bright."

13:07.160 --> 13:08.390
From one lamp,

13:09.120 --> 13:10.480
many lamps are lit,

13:12.000 --> 13:14.000
until ten thousand lamps shine bright.

13:16.270 --> 13:17.784
The light of a single lamp is faint

13:18.200 --> 13:20.200
and can illuminate only a small space.

13:21.200 --> 13:22.630
But if I light one lamp,

13:23.440 --> 13:24.720
and you light another,

13:25.360 --> 13:28.150
and Yuchan, Gantang, Baogai, Xiaolian,

13:28.480 --> 13:30.360
Furong, Ji'er, and the others

13:30.360 --> 13:31.440
each light one, too,

13:33.000 --> 13:34.510
then even the faint glow of fireflies,

13:35.120 --> 13:36.360
when gathered together,

13:37.150 --> 13:39.030
can illuminate an entire street

13:40.000 --> 13:41.870
and show women
traveling through the dark

13:42.720 --> 13:44.000
the way forward.

13:44.000 --> 13:48.940
♪Deep within the lights
lies a truth that came too late♪

13:48.960 --> 13:50.480
And there's Mister Shen Rugu.

13:51.030 --> 13:52.510
Though he isn't a woman,

13:52.720 --> 13:54.120
he helped light the way for us too,

13:54.510 --> 13:56.000
and his lamp shines especially bright.

13:56.200 --> 13:57.750
It was after seeing a play he wrote

13:57.832 --> 13:59.992
that I resolved
to leave the confines of my home.

14:09.270 --> 14:10.840
I'm hungry.

14:13.550 --> 14:14.840
We'll eat when we get home.

14:20.670 --> 14:21.720
His Lordship is back.

14:24.960 --> 14:25.790
Where's Xiuwan?

14:27.670 --> 14:30.120
Aunt Lingxiao took
her away in tears, of course.

14:47.790 --> 14:49.240
Old Coachman Yue was killed.

14:51.256 --> 14:52.840
I've already instructed Head Butler Yang

14:52.968 --> 14:54.840
to make proper arrangements
for his family.

14:59.832 --> 15:01.600
You must catch
the killer, Your Lordship.

15:02.550 --> 15:03.360
By the way,

15:04.328 --> 15:06.080
this is a clue about the kidnappers left

15:06.210 --> 15:07.768
by the righteous man who saved Xiuwan.

15:10.790 --> 15:12.870
What's his name? Where does he live?

15:13.272 --> 15:15.140
I'll visit him tomorrow
to thank him in person.

15:15.200 --> 15:16.240
Xiuwan said

15:16.370 --> 15:18.720
he left
after escorting them to the city gate.

15:19.592 --> 15:21.150
She didn't understand why at the time,

15:21.450 --> 15:22.840
but only realized afterward

15:23.320 --> 15:26.270
that he must have guessed they
wouldn't report it to the authorities,

15:26.360 --> 15:27.840
so he left this letter.

15:28.216 --> 15:30.408
He said it contained
portraits of the kidnappers.

15:30.600 --> 15:33.120
They could be handed over
to the authorities or burned.

15:36.616 --> 15:38.870
There are plenty of people in this world
who blindly follow convention

15:38.870 --> 15:40.320
and seek fame under false pretenses.

15:41.510 --> 15:42.630
I never expected this man

15:43.016 --> 15:44.440
to be not only noble in character,

15:44.968 --> 15:46.510
but also open-minded and adaptable.

15:47.240 --> 15:48.240
He truly is remarkable.

16:02.960 --> 16:04.080
His brushwork is masterful,

16:04.472 --> 16:06.136
and his skill at drawing is exceptional.

16:08.440 --> 16:09.440
I'll give the order now

16:09.500 --> 16:11.256
to post notices
for the criminals' arrest.

16:13.576 --> 16:15.336
If you let word
of Xiuwan's ordeal get out,

16:15.368 --> 16:17.390
Aunt Lingxiao
will surely go to the family shrine,

16:17.390 --> 16:19.990
bring out the instruments of
family punishment, and come after you.

16:21.000 --> 16:22.670
I should have
explained it clearly to you.

16:23.720 --> 16:26.240
It's them. They robbed
the tribute goods bound for the capital

16:26.360 --> 16:27.600
and killed Commander Ding

16:27.670 --> 16:29.030
and every soldier aboard.

16:34.150 --> 16:36.910
No wonder they abducted
the weavers and stole the loom.

16:37.336 --> 16:39.256
They must be colluding
with an overseas kingdom

16:39.304 --> 16:41.150
that covets
our realm's weaving techniques.

16:42.200 --> 16:43.120
You guessed right.

16:43.448 --> 16:44.648
They're not river bandits.

16:44.910 --> 16:46.080
They're pirates from the sea.

16:46.480 --> 16:48.030
They usually hide out at sea.

16:49.030 --> 16:50.480
No wonder Jiugao and Nanke

16:50.550 --> 16:53.496
have been investigating for over
ten days without finding a single clue.

16:55.120 --> 16:56.870
Why would pirates come to Jinling?

16:57.840 --> 16:59.320
Even if they wanted to abduct weavers,

16:59.600 --> 17:02.120
Songjiang Prefecture
is closer to the coast than Jinling.

17:04.550 --> 17:05.680
Bring them back.

17:05.912 --> 17:07.416
Once we interrogate them, we'll know.

17:18.860 --> 17:20.580
(Wanted)

17:20.590 --> 17:21.400
Come take a look!

17:21.590 --> 17:22.000
Look.

17:22.000 --> 17:23.470
Anyone who reports their whereabouts

17:23.528 --> 17:25.060
will be rewarded twenty taels of silver.

17:25.070 --> 17:26.070
Twenty taels?

17:26.720 --> 17:27.270
That's a lot.

17:28.550 --> 17:29.270
Twenty taels!

17:29.480 --> 17:30.070
Let's go.

17:30.070 --> 17:31.640
The authorities have already
posted notices at the city gate,

17:31.720 --> 17:33.030
offering a reward for our capture.

17:33.030 --> 17:33.620
(Wanted)

17:33.630 --> 17:34.270
Chief,

17:34.830 --> 17:36.400
we should hurry back out to sea.

17:50.720 --> 17:51.400
Chief...

17:51.550 --> 17:53.030
No... Young Master!

17:53.030 --> 17:53.680
I was wrong.

17:53.750 --> 17:54.700
I won't do it again.

17:59.310 --> 18:00.750
Young Master, we were wrong.

18:01.000 --> 18:01.790
We were wrong.

18:01.790 --> 18:02.830
We really were wrong.

18:03.400 --> 18:04.310
It was our fault.

18:04.310 --> 18:05.440
It was all our fault.

18:05.440 --> 18:06.510
We really were wrong.

18:08.350 --> 18:10.200
The authorities are looking for pirates.

18:11.550 --> 18:13.880
You're all respectable merchants
with clean records.

18:14.110 --> 18:15.270
What are you afraid of?

18:16.920 --> 18:17.350
Yes.

18:18.160 --> 18:19.640
You're right, Young Master.

18:19.640 --> 18:20.400
We're not afraid.

18:21.310 --> 18:21.790
Not afraid.

18:21.920 --> 18:22.720
Get out, all of you.

18:22.856 --> 18:23.920
Thank you, Young Master.

19:25.880 --> 19:27.200
You want to serve me?

19:30.310 --> 19:31.110
Yes.

20:05.440 --> 20:06.310
Finish the job,

20:06.696 --> 20:08.550
and then clean yourself up
and come serve me.

20:21.830 --> 20:22.920
Xie Zhao,

20:25.880 --> 20:27.350
I underestimated you.

20:34.620 --> 20:41.740
(Wanted)

20:41.750 --> 20:43.550
Lin Jinqi.

20:44.030 --> 20:45.830
Xu Lanxiang.

20:48.110 --> 20:49.720
It's been sixteen years.

20:52.720 --> 20:53.720
You don't even

20:55.350 --> 20:56.880
recognize me anymore.

21:02.580 --> 21:08.700
(Glorify the Family Name)

21:24.160 --> 21:25.160
Xiuwan.

21:26.590 --> 21:27.680
Wrong.

21:28.830 --> 21:29.720
Xiushu.

21:31.960 --> 21:32.960
Wrong again.

21:33.550 --> 21:34.480
Xiuru.

21:36.720 --> 21:38.240
Lanxiang, you're biased against me.

21:38.550 --> 21:40.480
Can't I laugh and joke around

21:40.590 --> 21:42.110
like Xiuwan and Xiushu?

21:43.790 --> 21:45.030
I was being unfair.

21:45.350 --> 21:46.510
Forgive me, Xiuru.

21:47.688 --> 21:49.310
What are you thinking about, Lanxiang?

21:49.440 --> 21:50.720
You were so lost in thought

21:50.920 --> 21:52.510
you didn't even hear us come in.

21:53.640 --> 21:55.920
In the letter left
by the righteous man who saved you,

21:56.000 --> 21:57.720
he drew portraits of three pirates.

21:58.480 --> 22:00.310
One of them had half his face covered.

22:00.680 --> 22:01.720
For some reason,

22:02.070 --> 22:03.240
I keep thinking about him.

22:03.368 --> 22:05.816
I feel as though
I've seen him somewhere before.

22:06.240 --> 22:07.480
But when I think carefully,

22:08.030 --> 22:10.240
I've never seen
a man who looks like him.

22:19.000 --> 22:20.400
What about you, Xiuwan?

22:24.110 --> 22:27.160
Me? You know me.

22:27.720 --> 22:30.070
I can't even remember what the kidnapper

22:30.070 --> 22:31.640
who chased me with a knife looked like.

22:32.400 --> 22:33.310
Xiuwan,

22:33.550 --> 22:34.830
you're really no help at all.

22:35.208 --> 22:36.328
I was terrified at the time.

22:36.330 --> 22:38.580
I was so panicked.
All I could think about was escaping.

22:38.600 --> 22:40.568
How could I have stopped
to look at his face?

22:43.030 --> 22:44.030
Lanxiang,

22:44.400 --> 22:45.350
look at her.

22:45.790 --> 22:47.830
Xiuru is getting fiercer by the day.

22:47.896 --> 22:50.616
What happened to the sweet
and delicate girl she used to be?

22:55.110 --> 22:56.790
Xiuru is indeed more...

23:14.200 --> 23:15.000
Lanxiang?

23:17.030 --> 23:18.070
I remember

23:18.750 --> 23:19.880
who that man looks like.

23:22.720 --> 23:24.510
Xiuwan and I know him, too?

23:27.720 --> 23:29.000
Du Cuique.

23:35.240 --> 23:36.030
Back then,

23:36.960 --> 23:38.590
Du Cuique was sentenced to exile...

23:38.920 --> 23:40.070
Qiongzhou...

23:40.640 --> 23:42.920
On the way to Qiongzhou,

23:43.032 --> 23:45.800
Du Cuique fell ill with malaria
after failing to adapt to the climate.

23:45.880 --> 23:47.110
Then she encountered bandits.

23:48.000 --> 23:49.640
In the chaos, she failed to escape

23:50.200 --> 23:51.240
and was killed.

23:52.200 --> 23:53.920
Du Cuique is cunning

23:53.960 --> 23:55.400
and skilled at manipulating people.

23:56.110 --> 23:58.200
Perhaps she wasn't
killed by the bandits at all,

23:58.408 --> 24:00.984
but instead seized the opportunity
to fake her death and escape.

24:01.310 --> 24:02.590
Lanxiang is right.

24:03.400 --> 24:05.750
Du Cuique
may have had someone die in her place

24:06.480 --> 24:07.720
and left with the bandits.

24:08.790 --> 24:10.160
But the pirate leader

24:10.960 --> 24:11.960
is a man.

24:14.590 --> 24:16.310
I had a vague feeling something was off,

24:16.360 --> 24:18.040
but no matter
how hard I thought about it,

24:18.070 --> 24:20.270
I couldn't recall any man
with a similar face.

24:20.360 --> 24:22.510
That's because
I was thinking in the wrong direction.

24:23.070 --> 24:24.350
I simply assumed

24:24.480 --> 24:26.960
that since the pirate
in the portrait was their leader,

24:27.310 --> 24:28.720
he must naturally be a man.

24:30.480 --> 24:33.030
I always say
we shouldn't underestimate women,

24:33.590 --> 24:35.550
yet I let my own assumptions

24:36.310 --> 24:37.400
blind me.

24:42.920 --> 24:43.750
Impossible.

24:46.550 --> 24:47.830
If it really was Du Cuique,

24:48.510 --> 24:50.160
why would she let me escape so easily?

24:50.830 --> 24:52.720
Du Cuique hasn't changed.

24:53.416 --> 24:56.264
She still treats servants and commoners
as if their lives mean nothing.

24:56.408 --> 24:57.680
She probably never even looked

24:57.680 --> 24:59.550
at the weavers they abducted.

25:08.110 --> 25:09.590
Whether it's Du Cuique or not,

25:10.110 --> 25:11.640
we need to tell His Lordship at once.

25:33.110 --> 25:33.920
It's her.

25:35.160 --> 25:36.160
It's Du Cuique.

25:37.400 --> 25:38.200
Xiuwan.

25:42.720 --> 25:44.240
Lanxiang and I have both confirmed it.

25:44.590 --> 25:46.000
Jinqi has seen Du Cuique, too.

25:46.550 --> 25:47.720
Once he confirms it,

25:47.880 --> 25:49.200
we can be absolutely certain.

25:51.590 --> 25:52.790
Other than Lanxiang,

25:53.960 --> 25:55.160
what woman's face

25:55.160 --> 25:57.048
could I possibly
remember for over ten years?

25:59.550 --> 26:01.720
I can't even remember now

26:01.864 --> 26:03.528
whether her eyes were big or small.

26:21.200 --> 26:21.960
Don't be afraid.

26:25.000 --> 26:26.720
Even Xiuru has grown fierce now.

26:27.440 --> 26:29.510
Even if Du Cuique
has come back from the dead,

26:30.350 --> 26:31.920
if we caught her once,

26:32.480 --> 26:33.920
we can catch her again.

27:20.310 --> 27:21.550
It's Du Cuique.

27:22.830 --> 27:24.000
A pirate leader

27:24.504 --> 27:25.790
wouldn't leave her hideout at sea

27:26.480 --> 27:27.960
and risk coming to Jinling

27:29.160 --> 27:30.640
just for the weavers.

27:31.464 --> 27:33.944
She must be here
to take revenge on Jinqi and Lanxiang.

27:40.790 --> 27:43.110
Let Lin Jinqi and Xu Lanxiang

27:44.640 --> 27:46.310
think I came to Jinling

27:46.960 --> 27:48.310
for revenge.

27:52.000 --> 27:52.790
But then again,

27:53.830 --> 27:54.920
it's not entirely wrong.

27:56.440 --> 27:58.750
I do want them dead.

28:01.790 --> 28:02.720
My brother

28:04.240 --> 28:06.160
is still waiting in the underworld

28:07.310 --> 28:09.200
for them to answer for what they did.

28:12.380 --> 28:20.180
(Glorify the Family Name)

28:26.590 --> 28:28.550
I'll help you kill them.

28:36.480 --> 28:38.240
I once went to great lengths

28:39.200 --> 28:40.880
to marry into the Lin family.

28:45.960 --> 28:47.720
I really did choose well.

28:49.240 --> 28:50.880
I wasn't wrong about him at all.

28:54.510 --> 28:57.480
Lin Jinqi was indeed made
a marquis and granted a title.

29:00.920 --> 29:01.920
What a pity.

29:03.240 --> 29:04.440
I wasn't skilled enough

29:05.310 --> 29:06.640
and lost by a single move.

29:08.400 --> 29:09.400
Otherwise,

29:11.750 --> 29:12.790
by now,

29:14.000 --> 29:17.030
I'd be the Marchioness
of Marquis Jing'an's Residence.

29:21.790 --> 29:23.480
Why is there still
no word from the north?

29:31.920 --> 29:34.070
Once you return
with news from the Zhejiang coast,

29:36.030 --> 29:38.030
there will be good news.

29:53.310 --> 29:55.440
Lin Jinqi.

30:06.270 --> 30:07.510
You're highly skilled in combat.

30:08.310 --> 30:09.830
Why would you commit such treason

30:10.310 --> 30:11.920
and kill a court official?

30:12.720 --> 30:14.070
On the Chief's orders,

30:14.536 --> 30:15.960
I've come to deliver you a letter!

30:27.512 --> 30:29.070
And take your head while I'm at it,

30:29.070 --> 30:30.110
as an offering to Du Zheng!

30:47.510 --> 30:48.270
Du Zheng.

31:04.680 --> 31:06.070
I'll hold them off.

31:06.664 --> 31:08.392
You hurry back
to Jinling and report this.

31:09.260 --> 31:11.480
(Ding Peng)
I'll hold them off. You should leave.

31:11.550 --> 31:12.550
That's an order.

31:19.440 --> 31:20.920
Du Zheng deserved to die.

31:26.480 --> 31:27.830
Even if I hadn't killed him,

31:28.920 --> 31:30.240
his crimes were unforgivable.

31:31.960 --> 31:32.960
Kill him!

31:44.350 --> 31:45.030
Ding Peng!

31:45.400 --> 31:46.160
Go!

31:48.960 --> 31:49.640
Go!

31:49.640 --> 31:50.510
Hurry!

31:55.480 --> 31:57.110
You have plundered the people

31:57.400 --> 31:58.830
and taken countless lives.

31:59.270 --> 32:00.830
By law, you must be executed.

35:51.960 --> 35:53.630
Urgent dispatch, 400 km!

35:54.190 --> 35:56.000
Urgent dispatch, 400 km!

35:57.190 --> 35:59.150
Urgent dispatch, 400 km!

35:59.820 --> 36:02.860
(Jinling Defense Command)

36:15.360 --> 36:17.528
His Majesty personally
led a campaign against Wona.

36:18.280 --> 36:19.480
After reaching Huailai,

36:20.070 --> 36:23.360
he was misled by Wang Yi, Chief
Eunuch of the Directorate of Ceremonial.

36:23.670 --> 36:25.510
Ignoring the objections of his generals,

36:26.030 --> 36:28.110
he ordered
the camp moved closer to the water.

36:28.710 --> 36:33.150
Wona forces charged
down from Yao'er Ridge.

36:40.000 --> 36:41.440
The imperial banners fell.

36:41.752 --> 36:44.408
The bodies of civil and
military officials covered the fields.

36:44.440 --> 36:45.320
His Majesty...

36:45.960 --> 36:48.630
His Majesty was captured by the enemy.

36:51.360 --> 36:52.400
That can't be!

36:52.488 --> 36:54.810
His Majesty marched out
with two hundred thousand troops!

36:54.960 --> 36:57.224
How could these
tens of thousands of Wona soldiers...

36:58.670 --> 36:59.440
capture him?

37:00.550 --> 37:01.150
This...

37:01.920 --> 37:03.880
What are we to do?

37:04.440 --> 37:07.670
What should we do now?

37:08.040 --> 37:09.624
It is now the end of the ninth month.

37:09.880 --> 37:11.280
His Majesty has been held captive

37:11.510 --> 37:12.710
for over a month.

37:13.400 --> 37:15.710
Your Grace, do you know
the situation in the capital?

37:16.232 --> 37:18.184
Has the Empress Dowager
issued any decree?

37:18.710 --> 37:21.710
The realm cannot
be without a ruler for even a day.

37:22.712 --> 37:24.550
After the terrible news
reached the capital,

37:24.920 --> 37:27.110
the Empress Dowager
accepted Han Liang's proposal

37:27.550 --> 37:29.670
and installed Prince Chen
as the new Emperor.

37:30.920 --> 37:31.840
Now, His Majesty

37:32.000 --> 37:34.970
(His Majesty, formerly Prince Chen)
has successfully ascended the throne.

37:34.984 --> 37:37.400
Han Liang was appointed Minister of War.

37:39.030 --> 37:41.030
Minister Han has ordered

37:42.000 --> 37:44.190
troops from across
the realm to rush to the capital

37:44.440 --> 37:46.760
and join forces against the Wona army.

37:46.960 --> 37:49.070
The Jinling Defense Command
is hereby ordered

37:49.070 --> 37:50.960
to allocate bows,
crossbows, swords, and spears,

37:50.960 --> 37:53.160
one million two hundred sixty thousand
weapons in total,

37:53.192 --> 37:55.416
along with four hundred thousand shi
of provisions.

37:55.720 --> 37:58.400
The Longjiang Garrison shall
select two thousand elite soldiers

37:58.710 --> 38:00.590
to escort them to the capital.

38:01.920 --> 38:02.710
We obey.

38:03.550 --> 38:06.960
The Wona army is at
the gates of the capital.

38:07.150 --> 38:08.510
I ask all of you

38:08.590 --> 38:10.150
to stand together

38:10.480 --> 38:12.840
and resist the enemy.

38:13.000 --> 38:13.800
- Yes.
- Yes.

38:23.230 --> 38:24.110
Mother.

38:26.840 --> 38:28.190
I want to give some to Father.

38:28.190 --> 38:29.440
Zhangrun, don't be naughty.

38:38.400 --> 38:38.880
Come.

38:59.070 --> 39:01.230
Zhangrun prepared
some Chinese yam cakes for you.

39:03.800 --> 39:04.590
Really?

39:16.400 --> 39:19.110
Thank you, Zhangrun, for the cakes.

39:20.190 --> 39:21.400
Thank you, Zhangcheng,

39:21.840 --> 39:23.230
for helping me pack.

39:29.630 --> 39:31.480
This is a protective charm I prayed for.

39:32.230 --> 39:35.280
My teacher said weapons
show no mercy on the battlefield.

39:35.670 --> 39:37.800
Father, you must be careful.

39:38.550 --> 39:40.030
You must come home safely.

39:45.360 --> 39:46.480
I'll remember that.

39:47.110 --> 39:48.550
I'll be sure to come home safely.

40:02.780 --> 40:04.660
(Blessing)

40:07.530 --> 40:10.530
♪The moon kisses the rising smoke♪

40:11.660 --> 40:15.220
♪Whose oil lamp burns tonight?♪

40:15.900 --> 40:18.720
♪Peace of heart in three places♪

40:19.620 --> 40:22.820
♪The years are calluses in our palms♪

40:23.960 --> 40:26.470
♪And the worries
etched between our brows♪

40:26.500 --> 40:27.230
It's very late.

40:27.630 --> 40:29.150
Zhangrun should go to bed.

40:29.320 --> 40:30.920
Otherwise, you won't grow tall.

40:31.960 --> 40:32.880
Go to bed now.

40:32.880 --> 40:35.560
♪While two pairs of eyes
watch from below♪

40:38.110 --> 40:41.740
♪Flowers bloom again by the fence♪

40:43.360 --> 40:44.000
Go on.

40:46.500 --> 40:50.970
♪Four seasons
wax and wane, year after year♪

40:51.912 --> 40:53.230
It's dark and raining heavily.

40:53.630 --> 40:54.670
Take a few more lanterns.

40:55.110 --> 40:56.630
Watch your step. The road is slippery.

40:58.150 --> 40:58.710
Yes.

41:01.030 --> 41:01.590
Let's go.

41:03.140 --> 41:07.360
♪The journey home
always carries joy and sorrow♪

41:07.650 --> 41:11.970
♪People gather, then part♪

41:57.070 --> 41:58.550
The situation in the capital

41:58.800 --> 42:00.000
is uncertain now.

42:00.728 --> 42:03.510
And Du Cuique is still lurking
in the shadows, waiting for her chance.

42:04.920 --> 42:07.960
Yet I've been ordered
to escort provisions to the capital.

42:09.510 --> 42:10.320
The burden

42:11.230 --> 42:12.480
on your shoulders

42:13.230 --> 42:14.230
is no lighter than mine.

42:20.070 --> 42:21.710
Du Zheng died because of you.

42:22.150 --> 42:23.800
Du Cuique was convicted because of me.

42:25.150 --> 42:26.800
I understand why she wants revenge.

42:28.070 --> 42:29.590
But it's been sixteen years.

42:30.800 --> 42:32.550
Why did she wait until now

42:33.000 --> 42:34.760
when the Retired Emperor
has been captured,

42:35.150 --> 42:36.510
and the capital is under siege?

42:40.320 --> 42:41.110
Could it be

42:41.960 --> 42:43.510
that fortune truly favors the wicked

42:43.608 --> 42:45.320
and handed Du Cuique this opportunity?

42:48.510 --> 42:49.400
You suspect

42:50.800 --> 42:52.670
Du Cuique
deliberately chose this moment?

42:58.550 --> 42:59.190
Your Lordship!

43:00.110 --> 43:00.880
Your Lordship!

43:05.020 --> 43:07.940
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:09.190 --> 43:13.670
Strike a man in the face
and attack his sorest point.

43:15.440 --> 43:17.400
Such underhanded tactics

43:18.030 --> 43:19.440
would never occur to someone

43:19.440 --> 43:21.032
of Lin Jinqi's privileged upbringing.

43:22.110 --> 43:24.710
Only that lowly servant Xu Lanxiang

43:25.280 --> 43:27.030
knows what I want

43:27.030 --> 43:28.320
and what I despise.

43:29.150 --> 43:30.550
I'll kill Xu Lanxiang for you

43:30.670 --> 43:33.800
and wash away today's
humiliation with her blood.

43:37.440 --> 43:39.150
This time, I'll do it myself.

43:42.590 --> 43:45.150
I'll kill Xu Lanxiang with my own hands.

44:01.860 --> 44:05.980
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:08.820 --> 44:13.340
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:14.620 --> 44:18.540
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:19.220 --> 44:21.980
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:22.700 --> 44:25.020
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:25.020 --> 44:28.100
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:29.620 --> 44:33.860
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:36.780 --> 44:40.940
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:42.740 --> 44:46.300
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:46.300 --> 44:49.860
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:50.660 --> 44:56.340
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:56.700 --> 45:01.020
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:01.380 --> 45:04.340
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:04.340 --> 45:08.100
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:08.100 --> 45:10.980
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:10.980 --> 45:15.060
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:15.060 --> 45:18.420
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:18.420 --> 45:22.180
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:22.180 --> 45:26.180
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:26.940 --> 45:31.100
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:31.100 --> 45:34.540
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:34.540 --> 45:38.180
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:38.180 --> 45:41.060
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:41.060 --> 45:45.140
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:45.140 --> 45:48.500
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:48.500 --> 45:52.140
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:52.140 --> 45:59.940
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
